{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Langlands对偶"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Langlands 对偶群"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>设 $G$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"约化群","text":"约化"}},{"Plain":"代数群, 其 Langlands 对偶 ${^LG}$ 是置换其"},{"Local":{"url":"根","text":"根"}},{"Plain":"数据所得的另一个代数群.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Langlands对应","text":"Langlands 对应"}},{"Plain":" 将\n$G$ (准确地说是 $G(\\mathbb A_F)$) 的自守表示联系到 $^LG$-值的 Galois 表示 (即同态 $\\mathrm {Gal}(\\overline{F}/F)\\to {^LG}$).</p>\n<p>Langlands 对偶群也可由"},{"Local":{"url":"佐武等价","text":"佐武等价"}},{"Plain":"定义.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>规范理论中的 Langlands 对偶</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A gauge theory has a coupling constant $g$, which plays the role of the electric charge $e$. The conjectural non-abelian electro-magnetic duality, which has later become known as $S$-duality, has the form $(G, g) \\leftrightarrow (^LG, 1/g)$.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Langlands纲领","text":"Langlands 纲领"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"局部几何Langlands对应","text":"局部几何 Langlands 对应"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}